Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<span id="demoNarration" style="display:block;margin:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.25;max-width:260px">Both source panels are visible at full opacity: panel a) shows the same three-hidden-unit network with parameter annotations, while panel b) shows the cleaner computation graph.</span>
<span style="display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center"><button onclick="prevStep()">◀</button><span id="stepLabel" style="flex:1">1 / 4 — Original two-panel comparison</span><button onclick="nextStep()">▶</button></span>
<label>Emphasis: <output id="emphasisModeVal">Original figure</output><select id="emphasisModeInput" onchange="update_emphasisMode(this.value)"><option>Original figure</option><option>θ input weights</option><option>φ output weights</option><option>Bias terms</option></select></label>
